    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's walk through the live television exchange step by step.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "michel",
      "t": "Virginie Efira!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Introducing Virginie Efira!' Michel Drucker introduces his special guest to the television audience.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "virginie",
      "t": "Michel, bonjour. Bonjour, mon amour.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Michel, hello. Hello, my love.' Virginie greets both the host and her partner.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ramzy",
      "t": "C'est super que tu sois là.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's great that you're here.' Caught off guard on live television, Ramzy pretends he is thrilled to see her.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "virginie",
      "t": "Les surprises, c'est important.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Surprises are important.' Virginie replies pointedly that surprises keep a relationship alive.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ramzy",
      "t": "Il y a pire que l'ennui dans une relation.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There are worse things than boredom in a relationship.' Ramzy nervously agrees that boredom is not the worst thing in a relationship.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "virginie",
      "t": "Certaines surprises sont indésirables.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Some surprises are unwelcome.' Virginie stares right at him and says some surprises are very unwelcome.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ramzy",
      "t": "Comme là, maintenant.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Like right now.' Ramzy mutters that her ambush right now is one of those unwelcome surprises.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "michel",
      "t": "Regardons un extrait du film.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's watch a clip of the film.' Sensing a brawl, the host quickly tries to roll a clip from their movie.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ramzy",
      "t": "Qu'est-ce que tu fais là? C'est tellement gênant.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you doing here? It's so awkward.' Ramzy whispers furiously while the clip rolls.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "virginie",
      "t": "T'es tellement horrible.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are so horrible.' Virginie drops the polite act and tells Ramzy how horrible he is.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ramzy",
      "t": "Je suis horrible?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am horrible?' Ramzy questions Virginie's blunt accusation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "virginie",
      "t": "Complètement!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Totally!' She confirms wholeheartedly that she means every word.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "michel",
      "t": "On est en direct...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We are live on air...' Michel urgently warns the arguing couple as the cameras return.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ramzy",
      "t": "Tu peux garder l'argent.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You can keep the money.' Cornered on the air, Ramzy tells her she can keep the extra money.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "virginie",
      "t": "Parce que je t'aime.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Because I love you.' Virginie confesses the real reason she is so furious with him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "michel",
      "t": "Quel couple volcanique!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What a volcanic couple!' The host marvels at their fiery reconciliation in front of the cameras.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "virginie",
      "t": "Oui, ça en vaut la peine.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
